Books arrived last night! Great feeling, never gets old. @JSeyff and I worked hard to create an accessible and balanced guide to this unique asset class written from the middle ground between TradFi and DeFi which are merging quickly and where we - and the ETFs we cover - sit. Official release date is Nov 10th, avail for pre-order now: https://t.co/OcbxGyTtp4

Also, I had always wanted to write a book about the national debt (it was on my short list of topics) as I've always been uneasy with it. This book checked that box for me as we go deep into debasement, debt and inflation which is the root cause of the affordability problem which is front and center political issue these days. Mind-expanding topic, I learned a lot while writing it.

